Pick a food Pizza

### TITLE ###
typing filters the list before selecting
### OPTIONS ###
Hamburger
Pizza
Sushi
### KEYS ###
"su"
enter
### CHOICE ###
Sushi
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
Pick a food
> Hamburger
  Pizza
  Sushi
--- frame 1 (s) ---
Pick a food
/s
> Sushi
--- frame 2 (u) ---
Pick a food
/su
> Sushi
--- frame 3 (enter) ---
Pick a food Sushi

