### TITLE ###
reaching a prompt with no scripted keys fails loudly instead of hanging
### DESCRIPTION ###
The guard that matters most: without it this case would block on a terminal
that is not there, and a hung suite looks like broken infrastructure rather
than a missing KEYS section.
### OPTIONS ###
Hamburger
### CHOICE ###
error: interactive prompt reached without scripted keys: add a KEYS section to this case
